    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But moving forward to what? Just more decaded of being slightly better than nothing? It feels like I'm just dragging myself through this gray existence. If you knew you were never going to reach the peak, wouldn't you think it's more dignified to just stop? To not have to endure the slow decay of realizing you're nothing special?",
